          "assurance_tags": ["state-replay", "visibility-contract", "numeric-invariant"],
          "prompt": "Add bounded state behavior. A Show escalation guide button must reveal a previously hidden panel containing Escalation owner: Maya Chen. Add a separate Record review action backed by a numeric reviewed-count increment; one click must visibly reveal Review count: 1, while the ViewSpec replay must also assert two increments produce reviewed_count = 2. Preserve every earlier requirement. In a ViewSpec arm, express this in AppBundle V4 state, mutation, visibility, and replay contracts rather than editing generated output.",
          "acceptance": {
            "required_text": [
              "Field Dispatch",
              "Needs attention",
              "J-205",
              "J-204",
              "J-206",
              "J-207",
              "Show escalation guide",
              "Record review"
